  "interpretation_boundary": "This stage can establish a reproducible fixed-k structural-benefit frontier, exact nonnegative cost intervals, optimization gaps against recorded same-objective solvers, and QUBO scaling on five audited real-protein pools. It cannot establish docking enrichment, biological benefit, quantum speedup, quantum advantage, or direct hardware readiness."
